### Plan 19.A: SEO, public Khám phá post, UTM, studio keys (t2m), landing pages
@baseUrl = {{$dotenv BE_BASE_URL}}/api
@adminUrl = {{$dotenv BE_BASE_URL}}/admin
@adminToken = {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}
@studioKey = {{$dotenv STUDIO_KEY}}

### Sitemap: counts per type
GET {{baseUrl}}/seo/sitemap

### Sitemap: one file of rows (type course | partner | article | collection | pathway | explore | landing)
GET {{baseUrl}}/seo/sitemap?type=course&page=1

### Public Khám phá post (no login; only while the explore access mode is "all")
GET {{baseUrl}}/explore/public/1

### Count a visitor's view of it
POST {{baseUrl}}/explore/public/1/view

### An arrival with UTM parameters (the site sends this once per tab session)
POST {{baseUrl}}/track/landing
Content-Type: application/json

{"utm_source": "facebook", "utm_medium": "social", "utm_campaign": "ra-mat-v2", "utm_content": "explore-12"}

### Register with the first touch kept by the browser
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Phụ huynh thử", "phone": "0900000999", "password": "123456", "utm_source": "facebook", "utm_medium": "social", "utm_campaign": "ra-mat-v2", "utm_content": "explore-12", "landing_path": "/fun/explore/12/cau-vong", "first_seen_at": "2026-10-29T03:20:00.000Z"}

### Report "Nguồn khách" (admin)
GET {{adminUrl}}/acquisition?days=30
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Landing page (public): fails when unknown, switched off or under 3 courses
GET {{baseUrl}}/landing?path=boi/5-tuoi/quan-7

### Admin: landing pages (filter on | off | draft | few)
GET {{adminUrl}}/landing-pages?filter=off
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: look for combinations now (also runs every night at 5:40)
POST {{adminUrl}}/landing-pages/refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: switch one page on
PUT {{adminUrl}}/landing-pages/1/enabled
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabled": true}

### Admin: switch on every page with enough courses
POST {{adminUrl}}/landing-pages/enable-ready
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: AI draft of the introduction (needs ANTHROPIC_API_KEY)
POST {{adminUrl}}/landing-pages/1/intro/ai
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: save and approve the introduction (status none | draft | approved)
PUT {{adminUrl}}/landing-pages/1/intro
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"intro": "Đoạn giới thiệu đã đọc lại.", "status": "approved"}

### Admin: content reviewers
GET {{adminUrl}}/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: give a member the "Duyệt nội dung" permission (empty list takes it away)
PUT {{adminUrl}}/permissions/123
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"permissions": ["content_review"]}

### Admin: create a machine key for the "anyLEARN Studio" creator account (the key is shown once)
POST {{adminUrl}}/api-keys
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "t2m trên máy CoT", "userId": 123}

### Admin: social queue
GET {{adminUrl}}/social-queue
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: mark a queued social post as posted
PUT {{adminUrl}}/social-queue/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "posted", "postedUrl": "https://facebook.com/anylearn/posts/1"}

### Studio (t2m with its key): who am I
GET {{baseUrl}}/studio/me
X-Api-Key: {{studioKey}}

### Studio: numbers of my posts
GET {{baseUrl}}/studio/stats?days=30
X-Api-Key: {{studioKey}}

### Studio: propose a social post of a Khám phá post
POST {{baseUrl}}/studio/social-queue
X-Api-Key: {{studioKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"postId": 12, "channel": "facebook", "caption": "Vì sao cầu vồng có 7 màu?", "scheduledAt": "2026-11-02T12:00", "campaign": "ra-mat-v2"}
